			"start": 3.45,
			"end": 4.919,
			"en": "Thank you, doctor.",
			"zh": "谢谢您，医生。"
		},
		{
			"i": 2,
			"start": 6.45,
			"end": 11.202,
			"en": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
			"zh": "听录音，然后回答问题。"
		},
		{
			"i": 3,
			"start": 12.69,
			"end": 16.986,
			"en": "Who else is in bed today? Why?",
			"zh": "今天还有谁躺在床上？为什么？"
		},
		{
			"i": 4,
			"start": 19.22,
			"end": 20.923,
			"en": "How's Jimmy today?",
			"zh": "吉米今天怎么样了？"
		},
		{
			"i": 5,
			"start": 21.58,
			"end": 22.277,
			"en": "Better.",
			"zh": "好多了。"
		},
		{
			"i": 6,
			"start": 22.7,
			"end": 24.084,
			"en": "Thank you, doctor.",
			"zh": "谢谢您，医生。"
		},
		{
			"i": 7,
			"start": 25.01,
			"end": 28.173,
			"en": "Can I see him please, Mrs. Williams?",
			"zh": "我能看看他吗，威廉斯夫人？"
		},
		{
			"i": 8,
			"start": 29.28,
			"end": 30.816,
			"en": "Certainly, doctor.",
			"zh": "当然可以，医生。"
		},
		{
			"i": 9,
			"start": 31.35,
			"end": 32.877,
			"en": "Come upstairs.",
			"zh": "上楼来吧。"
		},
		{
			"i": 10,
			"start": 34.17,
			"end": 36.323,
			"en": "You look very well, Jimmy.",
			"zh": "你看上去很好，吉米。"
		},
		{
			"i": 11,
			"start": 37.09,
			"end": 41.533,
			"en": "You are better now, but you mustn't get up yet.",
			"zh": "你现在好些了，但是还不能起床。"
		},
		{
			"i": 12,
			"start": 42.6,
			"end": 46.717,
			"en": "You must stay in bed for another two days.",
			"zh": "你必须再卧床两天。"
		},
		{
			"i": 13,
			"start": 48.32,
			"end": 52.478,
			"en": "The boy mustn't go to school yet, Mrs. Williams.",
			"zh": "这孩子还不能去上学，威廉斯夫人。"
		},
		{
			"i": 14,
			"start": 53.21,
			"end": 56.038,
			"en": "And he mustn't eat rich food.",
			"zh": "他也不能吃油腻的食物。"
		},
		{
			"i": 15,
			"start": 58.11,
			"end": 61.417,
			"en": "Does he have a temperature, doctor?",
			"zh": "他发烧吗，医生？"
		},
		{
			"i": 16,
			"start": 62.09,
			"end": 63.649,
			"en": "No, he doesn't.",
			"zh": "不，他没有。"
		},
		{
			"i": 17,
			"start": 64.06,
			"end": 66.471,
			"en": "Must he stay in bed?",
			"zh": "他必须卧床吗？"
		},
		{
			"i": 18,
			"start": 67.06,
			"end": 72.026,
			"en": "Yes. He must remain in bed for another two days.",
			"zh": "是的。他必须再卧床两天。"
		},
		{
			"i": 19,
			"start": 72.84,
			"end": 81.218,
			"en": "He can get up for about two hours each day, but you must keep the room warm.",
			"zh": "他每天可以起床大约两小时，但是你必须保持房间温暖。"
		},
		{
			"i": 20,
			"start": 83.49,
			"end": 86.53,
			"en": "Where's Mr. Williams this evening?",
			"zh": "威廉斯先生今晚在哪儿？"
		},
		{
			"i": 21,
			"start": 87.35,
			"end": 89.755,
			"en": "He's in bed, doctor.",
			"zh": "他在床上，医生。"
		},
		{
			"i": 22,
			"start": 90.48,
			"end": 92.633,
			"en": "Can you see him please?",
			"zh": "您能去看看他吗？"
		},
		{
			"i": 23,
			"start": 93.24,
			"end": 96.574,
			"en": "He has a bad cold, too!",
			"zh": "他也得了重感冒！"
		}
